        <item>
            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:47:01 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://macaway.app</link>
            <sparkle:version>346</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li><b>Caffeine mode.</b> Keep your Mac awake for 1 to 12 hours, or until you turn it off. The screen stays on and the screen saver waits while you are at your Mac, and MacAway still locks it when you walk away. With the lid closed, your Mac stays awake only if an external display is connected.</li>
  <li><b>See it at a glance.</b> While Caffeine mode is on and your Mac is protected, steam rises from the shield in the menu bar.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
